.cache/*
## Papers are copyrighted and must not be committed. This is deliberately a blanket rule and
## covers symlinks to papers kept elsewhere on disk: a symlink commits its target path, and an
## unguarded `git add -A` in the repository root would otherwise pick one up.
*.pdf
